        "text": "Quillfern Cycle Works Menu Your bike, running like the day you got it A small repair workshop in Larkbend. Tune-ups, wheel builds and cargo bike care, done while you wait or by the next morning. Book a repair What we do Tune-ups Gears indexed, brakes set, chain cleaned and every bolt checked to torque. See tune-up levels Wheels Truing, spoke replacement and hand-built wheels for road, gravel and town bikes. See wheel work Cargo bikes Longtails and front-loaders, with the space and the stands to work on them properly. See cargo care Open today The workshop is open Tuesday to Saturday, 9:00 to 17:30. We are open right now. They had my commuter back the same afternoon, and it shifts better than it did new. A rider from Larkbend (a made-up quote for this test) Quillfern Cycle Works 14 Ferrule Lane, Larkbend Pages About Services Contact Quillfern Cycle Works is a fictional business, made for a software test. © 2026 Sample site, MIT licence.",
